WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.080
One handful of salt.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.620
Twenty four days of walking to

3
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.750
pick it up.

4
00:00:06.181 --> 00:00:08.981
In nineteen thirty, the law said

5
00:00:08.981 --> 00:00:11.081
Indians could not make their own

6
00:00:11.081 --> 00:00:13.881
salt. Every home needed it.

7
00:00:13.881 --> 00:00:16.191
Every home had to buy it.

8
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:19.048
Gandhi gave the Viceroy, Lord

9
00:00:19.048 --> 00:00:21.308
Irwin, advance notice of his

10
00:00:21.308 --> 00:00:24.568
march. Irwin, says our NCERT

11
00:00:24.568 --> 00:00:26.708
textbook, failed to grasp what

12
00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:27.638
it meant.

13
00:00:28.038 --> 00:00:29.658
The twelfth of March.

14
00:00:29.658 --> 00:00:32.178
At dawn, he left the Sabarmati

15
00:00:32.178 --> 00:00:33.858
ashram with seventy eight

16
00:00:33.858 --> 00:00:36.378
companions. That night, they

17
00:00:36.378 --> 00:00:38.028
stopped at Aslali.

18
00:00:38.442 --> 00:00:41.002
Anand, by the seventeenth.

19
00:00:41.002 --> 00:00:42.802
Ras, on the nineteenth.

20
00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:45.122
At each halt, he spoke to the

21
00:00:45.122 --> 00:00:46.492
people who gathered.

22
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:50.070
Broach, on the twenty sixth.

23
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.820
Surat, on the first of April.

24
00:00:53.389 --> 00:00:55.649
On the fifth of April, after

25
00:00:55.649 --> 00:00:58.129
about four hundred kilometres,

26
00:00:58.129 --> 00:01:00.679
they reached Dandi, by the sea.

27
00:01:01.116 --> 00:01:03.356
That evening he admitted he had

28
00:01:03.356 --> 00:01:04.916
expected to be stopped.

29
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.096
The government might let his

30
00:01:07.096 --> 00:01:09.256
party reach Dandi, he had

31
00:01:09.256 --> 00:01:11.886
thought, "but not me certainly."

32
00:01:12.645 --> 00:01:15.405
The next morning, the sixth of

33
00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:17.865
April, he picked up salt from

34
00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:20.655
the shore, and broke the law.

35
00:01:21.837 --> 00:01:22.817
For GS1 and Prelims:

36
00:01:22.817 --> 00:01:24.517
the Salt Satyagraha, Sabarmati

37
00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.797
to Dandi, March to April

38
00:01:27.797 --> 00:01:28.887
nineteen thirty.

39
00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:31.917
Salt touched every home, so the

40
00:01:31.917 --> 00:01:33.987
protest could reach every home.

41
00:01:34.793 --> 00:01:36.213
A long walk.

42
00:01:36.213 --> 00:01:38.333
A small handful.

43
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.483
And a country that understood.
